{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"34908","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v46784","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"オギンバラ(オギン★バラ、オギン☆バラ)","creatorId":"vndb:s3933","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:17800","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3933","name":"オギンバラ(オギン★バラ、オギン☆バラ)","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:270551","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"闇鍋","creatorId":"vndb:s3958","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:21434","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3958","name":"闇鍋","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:270550","source":"egs"}],"music":[],"other":[]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c130849","characterName":"アリエス・ブラッテンハルト","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c130849"},"originalCharacterName":"アリエス・ブラッテンハルト","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"95"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"165"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"87"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"57"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Princess of the Kingdom of Brattenhardt. She has a noble and dignified appearance and excels in both literary and military arts.She is passionate about her country and patriotism, and she believes that she must “protect her beloved people."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although she is royalty, as a princess knight, she has been involved in a wide range of activities, such as maintaining domestic security, fighting in war zones, and providing relief to disaster-stricken areas, and has achieved numerous feats of valor."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has been devoted to rigorous daily training in swordsmanship to strengthen her body and mind, so she has excellent proportions, with feminine features and toned parts."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Naturally, she has received offers of marriage from other countries because of her appearance, but she continues to decline."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Love to her is not her main priority."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She believes that her lover is in this country, until she meets the man of her dreams who she considers to be more desirable than she is."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has known Princesses Charlene and Mireia, with whom she has formed an alliance, since childhood and knows them well. They are also dear friends and have grown up together like sisters. She is the eldest of the three."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c130849"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a1/a1eedca972624dbf132444b9951d96243139567fa9bbd826421043ece2aee954.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/14/14a49de3b787ea76d6779a063218f601631674d6a63ee60cacf2a4560665475e.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"波野 夏花","creatorId":"vndb:s3225","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3225","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3225","name":"波野夏花(夏花)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:95796","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c130850","characterName":"シャルレーヌ・デュシャトール","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c130850"},"originalCharacterName":"シャルレーヌ・デュシャトール","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"89"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"158"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"84"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"55"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the princess of the kingdom of Duchâteau, which thrives on commerce and trade."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a beautiful girl with a style so attractive that everyone turns to look at her. Because of this, she is also active as an advertisement for the nation."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"On the other hand, she is proud and has a selfish side due to her spoiled upbringing. Compared to Aries and Mireia, who are close friends, she has a younger personality."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Because of this, the public believes that any man who becomes her future husband will have to endure a great deal of hardship. Despite her difficult personality, Aries and Mireia, who are her rare friends, and her family, including the king, call her by the nickname “Char.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c130850"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/38/38e06a90fc9c8d0bb087c6246613021bdef3c7c837d4fa5761c212cad7ba02fc.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ad/adcd3efdfa1d52e646cf94a6ac50bd54d4bcea55e589742a36e94cb6fb996d79.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"梅宮 ここ","creatorId":"vndb:s8768","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8768","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8768","name":"梅宮 ここ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:95797","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c130851","characterName":"ミレイア・フローレス","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c130851"},"originalCharacterName":"ミレイア・フローレス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"98"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"161"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"91"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"59"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the princess of the Kingdom of Flores, which is blessed with agricultural and mineral resources."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a ladylike personality, as is typical of a country with a rich natural environment, from the plains to the mountains. She is a neat girl with excellent manners and grace, and is called the “princess among princesses” for her compassionate heart."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her benevolent appearance and royal bearing are reminiscent of her own mother, the queen, and she has a strong following among the public."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a glamorous figure, especially with her ample breasts, which attract the eyes of others. Some call her the “Blessed Mountain of Flores” or not."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is engaged to the love of her life (Aries' brother, Wolff, the second prince of Brattenhardt), to whom she has promised her future."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c130851"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/19/19e83be75348e6c30e5af0941705d1f78aa5a94e74841e25e2805dcb5baf548d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/61/61c40ea056f6a61bc6596d1fb077d18b738055167c775329b0daf7f8700944f1.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"霧島 はるな","creatorId":"vndb:s2698","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2698","canonic